{'symbol': 'LHX', 'date': '2021-06-16 09:00:00', 'title': 'L3HARRIS TECHNOLOGIES UNVEILS XL EXTREME™ 400P EMERGENCY RESPONDER RADIO', 'text': 'MELBOURNE, FLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--L3HARRIS TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE:LHX) HAS EXPANDED ITS XL PLATFORM OF PROJECT 25 (P25) RADIOS TO INCLUDE THE NEW XL EXTREME™ 400P, THE FIRST AND ONLY HANDHELD RADIO DESIGNED TO MEET THE MOST RIGOROUS TWO-WAY, PORTABLE RF DEVICE STANDARDS FOR EMERGENCY RESPONDER COMMUNICATIONS. THE XL EXTREME RADIO AND ALL NEW SPEAKER MICROPHONE COMBINE TO CREATE A SOLUTION DESIGNED FOR OPTIMAL PERFORMANCE UNDER SEVERE ENVIRONMENTAL CONDITIONS, SUCH AS THOSE EXPERIENCED BY FIREFIGHTE'}